{"scene_id": "s00003", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s00003.fountain", "heading": "INT. SALT MINE CURLING HALL - NIGHT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "DEZ", "names": ["DEZ"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 4}, {"id": 1, "name": "PRATT", "names": ["PRATT"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 0}, {"id": 2, "name": "INEZ MOREAU", "names": ["INEZ MOREAU", "INEZ"], "gender": "?", "first": 7, "spoke": 5}, {"id": 3, "name": "ABEBE TESFAYE", "names": ["ABEBE TESFAYE", "ABEBE"], "gender": "m", "first": 8, "spoke": 2}, {"id": 4, "name": "FOREMAN GUS HALVERSEN", "names": ["FOREMAN GUS HALVERSEN", "GUS"], "gender": "m", "first": 18, "spoke": 4}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. SALT MINE CURLING HALL - NIGHT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A long gallery cut from white rock, lit by work lamps on cable.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Painted lanes run down the salt floor.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "At the far end, a faded house.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "The Deepwater Miners are down two ends in the final.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Their last stone is about to go.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "COACH DESMOND \"DEZ\" PRATT (50s, windbreaker, stopwatch on a lanyard) paces behind the hogline.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Skip INEZ MOREAU (30s, braided, taped knuckles) crouches in the house with her broom flat on the ice, calling the line.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "At the hack, lead ABEBE TESFAYE (20s, rangy, headband) slides out of his delivery, the stone rumbling off, while Dez mouths numbers and Inez sweeps nothing, waiting.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "The stone curls, hesitates, and dies a foot short of the button.", "para": 2, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Nobody speaks.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Salt dust drifts in the lamplight.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's the game.", "name": "DEZ", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's not. We have one more.", "name": "INEZ", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We had one more.", "name": "DEZ", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I pulled it. My fault.", "name": "ABEBE", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Your slide was fine. The ice was heavy.", "name": "INEZ", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Boots on the stairs.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "A man in a hard hat and reflective vest comes down the gallery, carrying a clipboard: FOREMAN GUS HALVERSEN (60s, soot in his creases, no smile).", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Dez straightens.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Inez rises.", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Abebe stands the broom against the wall and wipes his palms on his knees.", "para": 4, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Shift change in ten. You've got to clear the lane.", "name": "GUS", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Gus, we're mid-final.", "name": "DEZ", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You were mid-final.", "name": "GUS", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Give us the end. Please.", "name": "INEZ", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Gus looks at the stone, at the button, at the scoreboard.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Taps his pencil on the clipboard.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "One stone. Then you're out.", "name": "GUS", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Thank you.", "name": "DEZ", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Don't. Just throw it.", "name": "GUS", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Abebe picks up the stone.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "His hands shake.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Inez crosses to him and takes the handle for a second, then lets go.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Breathe out when you let go.", "name": "INEZ", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["softly"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know.", "name": "ABEBE", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know you know.", "name": "INEZ", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "He slides.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "It's a clean release.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "The stone goes long, slow, tired.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "It touches nothing.", "para": 7, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "The work lamps hum.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Gus checks his watch.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}]}